 style=\"font-size:17px\">GPU</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Mali G52 MC1</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">RAM</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">2GB</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Bộ nhớ trong</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">8GB</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Thiết kế</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Không viền cao cấp</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Màu sắc</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Xanh</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Chân đế</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Đôi</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Kích thước không đế</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">1668 × 76 × 959 mm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Kích thước có đế</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">1668 × 391 × 1027 mm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Chuẩn treo tường</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">400 × 300 mm</span></p></td></