le=\"font-size:17px\">Tổng khối lượng sản phẩm</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">17.3kg</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Kích thước sản phẩm</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">380*280*610mm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Kích thước đóng gói</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">413*327*656mm</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Thương hiệu</span></p></td><td><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Lumias</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:21px\">3. Báo giá máy hút ẩm 30L Lumias D6S-30L mới nhất</span></h2><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\" style=\"width: 100%;\"> <figure style=\"margin:0;width:100%\"> <img src=\"https://greenhomeshop.vn/uploads/products/thiet-ke-chua-co-ten-18_pc.webp\" srcset=\"https://greenhomeshop.vn/uploads/products/thiet-ke-chua-co-ten-18_mobile.webp 400w, https://greenhomeshop.vn/uploads/products/thiet-ke-chua-co-ten-18_tablet.webp 800w, https://greenhomeshop.vn/uploads/products/thiet-ke-chua-co-ten-18_pc.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1024px) 800px, 1200px\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block\" alt=\"product image\"> </figure> </div><p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px\"><em>Báo giá máy hút ẩm 30L Lumias D6S-30L mới nhất</em></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Giá cả luôn là một yếu tố quan trọng trong quyết định mua hàng. Tuy n